/-- The backward-Gaussian entropy data on the chart `Vec 2` at time `t`:
`ρ = ρ_{τ(t)}`, `f = f_{τ(t)}`, `|∇f|² = S/(4τ²)`, `|Ric + ∇²f|² = 1/(2τ²)`, `R = 0`,
`n = 2`, with the clamped `τ(t) = max (τ₀-t) (τ₀-t₁)`. -/
def gaussEntropyData (τ0 t1 : ℝ) (ht1 : t1 < τ0) (t : ℝ) : EntropyData (Vec 2) volume where
  R := 0
  gradSq := fun x => radSq x / (4 * (gaussTau τ0 t1 t) ^ 2)
